    'Opens PDF, EPUB, Word (docx, doc), Hangul (hwp, hwpx), Excel (xlsx), PowerPoint (pptx), TXT, images (jpg, png) and comics (cbz)': ['Ouvre PDF, EPUB, Word (docx, doc), Hangul (hwp, hwpx), Excel (xlsx), PowerPoint (pptx), TXT, images (jpg, png) et BD (cbz)', 'Открывает PDF, EPUB, Word (docx, doc), Hangul (hwp, hwpx), Excel (xlsx), PowerPoint (pptx), TXT, изображения (jpg, png) и комиксы (cbz)', 'Abre PDF, EPUB, Word (docx, doc), Hangul (hwp, hwpx), Excel (xlsx), PowerPoint (pptx), TXT, imágenes (jpg, png) y cómics (cbz)'],
